Description:It is your first main phase. You control two Grizzly Bears and have Predator Dragon (4/4 flying, haste, devour 2) in hand with six red mana floating. The opponent is at 8 life and controls a tapped Silent Arbiter (no more than one creature can attack each combat). Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
